  "next_id": 34,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -26,
        -32
      ],
      "id": 31,
      "text": "ATmega32A (experimental) at the factory clock (internal RC, 1 MHz) running avr32_demo. The firmware\nwrites JTD twice, so PC2-PC5 count (with the factory fuses they are the JTAG pins). RV1 on ADC0 sets\nTimer0's PWM on OC0 (PB3, LED1); SW1 on INT2 (PB2) toggles LED2 (PD7); the terminal (USART) shows RV1's\ncode and the differential reading ADC1 - ADC0 with a gain of 10: move RV2 a little around RV1."
    }
  ],
